# 🎮 PokéClicker

An incremental clicker game with Pokémon theme! Catch 'em all by clicking!

## 🎯 How to Play

1. **Click the Pokémon** to damage it and catch it
2. **Catch Pokémon** by reducing their HP to 0
3. **Buy Upgrades** to increase your damage and unlock auto-clickers
4. **Progress** through all 151 original Pokémon

## 🛍️ Available Upgrades

- **Poké Ball** (10 clicks) - +1 damage
- **Great Ball** (100 clicks) - +5 damage
- **Ultra Ball** (500 clicks) - +20 damage
- **Master Ball** (5,000 clicks) - +100 damage
- **Trainer** (1,000 clicks) - +0.1 clicks/second
- **Professor** (10,000 clicks) - +1 click/second
- **Pokédex** (50,000 clicks) - 2x damage multiplier

## 🎮 Features

- 151 Pokémon to catch
- Auto-save system (saves every 5 seconds)
- Beautiful gradient UI with responsive design
- Floating damage text
- Real-time statistics (clicks, Pokédex entries, clicks/second)
- Progressive difficulty with cost scaling

## 💾 Saves

Your progress is automatically saved to your browser's local storage. Your save will persist even after closing the browser!

## 🚀 Getting Started

Just open `index.html` in your browser and start clicking!

